captions:
There are two bearded dwarves dressed in finery and holding weapons standing on a platform and their names (Gog and Magog) are on the platform below. A tiny figure is in front of them in front of the platform. ||| A royal courts man stands before a giant statue of two men ; 
 The man on the left has a triton , sash, and long mustache and beard  , titled: "COG"  .
  The man to the right is holding a shield and spear , he also has a long beard and mustache , titled: "MACOG"

Three men, one quite fat, are sitting at a dinner table containing a roasted bird surrounded by vegetables. They are holding goblets and look like they are engrossed in conversation. ||| a fat king is sitting at a table, surrounded by two men who are watching him.;
The king is drinking from a cup
There is a large dish in front of the king with poultry and vegetables ||| Three men enjoying their food with drinks ang gossiping.
